---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Todo from '../components/Todo.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Shipping & returns" description="How delivery, payment, exchanges and returns work for Essential Outfits orders.">
  <div class="container page">
    <PageHeader eyebrow="Help" title="Shipping & returns" intro="How delivery, payment, exchanges and returns work." />

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>How orders work</h2>
      <p>
        You place your order by sending us your cart on WhatsApp. We reply to confirm that your items are in stock, the
        delivery charge for your PIN code and when to expect delivery. Your order is confirmed once you've agreed to the
        total and paid.
      </p>

      <h2>Delivery</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We deliver within India.</li>
        <li>Delivery charges and timelines depend on your location and are shared with you on WhatsApp before you pay.</li>
        <li>Once your order ships, we'll send you the courier and tracking details where available.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><Todo>typical dispatch time (e.g. within 2 business days), delivery times, and any free-delivery threshold.</Todo></p>

      <h2>Payment</h2>
      <p>
        We share payment options on WhatsApp when we confirm your order. Nothing is charged on this website.
        <Todo>the payment methods you accept (e.g. UPI, bank transfer, cash on delivery).</Todo>
      </p>

      <h2>Exchanges and returns</h2>
      <p>
        If something doesn't fit, or arrives damaged or wrong, message us on WhatsApp with your order details and a
        photo. Items should be unworn and unwashed, with original tags attached.
      </p>
      <p>
        <Todo>
          your return/exchange window (e.g. 7 days from delivery), who pays return shipping, and how refunds are made.
        </Todo>
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Get in touch any time from our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px);
  }
</style>
